## Why This Is Asked

This question assesses practical Azure OpenAI engineering skills for data generation with governance, privacy, and observability.

## Key Concepts

- Per-tenant data policy gating
- PII redaction using Text Analytics
- Grounding with Cognitive Search and versioned KB
- Auditable logging to Data Lake

## Code Example

```javascript
// Example pseudo-code: gate -> redact -> search -> openai
function handleInput(input, tenant) {
  if (!policyAllows(tenant, input)) throw new Error('Not allowed');
  const redacted = redactPII(input);
  const kb = searchKB(redacted, tenant);
  return callOpenAI(redacted, kb);
}
```

